{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Saloon Simulator Demo</strong> invites you to become the owner of your very own entertainment saloon!<br>Are you ready to start with a small bar and grow it into a massive game complex?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you will serve customer orders, manage various entertainment areas, and keep different game machines under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not all! Just like your customers, you\u2019ll also get to enjoy the games yourself! Grow your business while having fun in your own game saloon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive entertainment equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Service mechanics that increase customer satisfaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to design your own play area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing, humorous, and enjoyable simulation experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the \u201cGame Saloon\u201d of your dreams \u2014 manage it and have fun at the same time!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054950?t=1758901054","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054950?t=1758901054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054950/c73e3b25bf21974ff45ad40b9bc7ea65d337ad25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758901054","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054950/c73e3b25bf21974ff45ad40b9bc7ea65d337ad25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758901054","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Saloon Simulator Demo</strong> invites you to become the owner of your very own entertainment salo